/**
 * @fileoverview Dev-only synthetic dataset: wipe mood/goals/tasks/habit domains (not settings) and
 * re-seed moods + journal notes, goals (reminders + history), day todos (reminder minutes), and habit selections
 * from 2020-01-01 through local today.
 *
 * Mood + notes are generated by a small **life simulation** (latent wellness, swings, occasional good/bad
 * events, era-aware context) so reads like a real person over the years—not a static template per day.
 *
 * Synthetic data is **opt-in**: `await globalThis.KairoSeed.rebuild()` in dev, or
 * {@link runFullDemoRebuild} / {@link ensureDevFullDemoDatasetCurrent} from code when you explicitly want it.
 */

